      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling really weird all of a sudden. im shaking pretty bad and i'm super sweaty like even though its cold in here. i feel kinda dizzy/confused too. my blood sugar was actually a bit high like 180 an hour ago so i think i might be trending up again... should i just take an extra unit of my fast acting insulin now to bring it back down and steady myself?",
